    {
      "id": "p0051-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In November 2016, Toby announced an official Japanese version of Undertale was in the works. In August 2017, it was released for home computers, the PlayStation Vita handheld system, and the monstrously popular PlayStation 4 console. The game was released again for the Nintendo Switch in 2018, and the Xbox One in 2021.",
        "raw": "In November 2016, Toby announced an official Japanese version of Undertale\nwas in the works. In August 2017, it was released for home computers, the\nPlayStation Vita handheld system, and the monstrously popular PlayStation 4\nconsole. The game was released again for the Nintendo Switch in 2018, and the\nXbox One in 2021.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
