    {
      "id": "p0051-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Finally, nearly two years after its English debut, Japanese gamers could play Undertale in their native language, legitimately, and on all the popular game systems. This official release propelled Undertale into the spotlight, grabbing the attention of players and critics alike.",
        "raw": "Finally, nearly two years after its English debut, Japanese gamers could play\nUndertale in their native language, legitimately, and on all the popular game\nsystems. This official release propelled Undertale into the spotlight, grabbing\nthe attention of players and critics alike.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09371173,
          0.18967143,
          0.68476641,
